        <h1>See LID in <em>three different lights</em>.</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          One example is small, clean, intent-only — try to regenerate the code from the docs alone. One is a complete, working project — the whole chain from design to verified code, public and clonable. And one is real, long-running, and messier than any pedagogical example could honestly be. Three lenses; they answer different questions.
