      <h2 id="meta-heading">And LID itself.</h2>
      <p>
        This whole repository is <a href="{{ site.repoUrl }}">LID applied to LID</a>. The <a href="{{ site.repoUrl }}/blob/main/docs/high-level-design.md">HLD</a>, the <a href="{{ site.repoUrl }}/tree/main/docs/intent">LLDs</a>, the <a href="{{ site.repoUrl }}/blob/main/docs/intent/marketing-site/marketing-site-specs.md">EARS specs</a> — all live in <code>docs/</code>, traceable to the plugin code under <code>plugins/</code>. If LID could not describe itself, LID would be broken. It describes itself.
